{{!-- Cover chew card: ONE card per apply (cover.js chewCoverZone / chewCoverWall). The headline
      is the whole burst's debit; roundLines (present only when the burst had more than one
      debiting round) show the round-by-round wear, and brokeLine names the round the object
      gave out. A single debit posts exactly the card it always did.

      ⛔ THIS CARD NEVER APPEARS FOR CORE-MODE COVER (an SP entered with no structure). Those objects
      keep no ledger, so the chew sites return before rendering — see cover.js COVER_MODE_CORE.

      ⭐ THE BREACH LINE + REPAIR BUTTON (user ruling 2026-08-26). A wall whose structure reaches zero
      opens its movement, sight and sound restrictions, and the card SAYS SO and hands the referee the
      undo in the same breath — the breach is reversible by design, and a card that announced a hole in
      the map without saying how to close it would read as a one-way accident.
      `canRepair` is the GM render gate; `.cp-cover-repair` + data-wall-uuid are what cover.js
      registerCoverRepairButton dispatches on. --}}
<div class="cyberpunk cp-cover-chew">
    <h3>{{#if destroyed}}{{CPLocal "CoverDestroyedTitle"}}{{else}}{{CPLocal "CoverChewTitle"}}{{/if}}</h3>
    <p>{{CPLocal "CoverChewLine" name=label damage=damage}}{{#if weaponName}} ({{weaponName}}){{/if}}</p>
    {{#if roundLines}}
    <ul class="cp-cover-chew-rounds">
        {{#each roundLines}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}
    </ul>
    {{/if}}
    {{#if brokeLine}}<p class="cp-cover-broke-line">{{brokeLine}}</p>{{/if}}
    {{#if destroyed}}
    <p class="cp-cover-destroyed-line">{{#if doorOpened}}{{CPLocal "CoverDoorOpenedLine" name=label}}{{else}}{{CPLocal "CoverDestroyedLine" name=label}}{{/if}}</p>
    {{#if breached}}
    <p class="cp-cover-breach-line">{{CPLocal "CoverBreachLine" name=label}}</p>
    {{/if}}
    {{#if canRepair}}
    <div class="save-buttons">
        <button class="cp-cover-repair" data-wall-uuid="{{wallUuid}}" data-tooltip="{{CPLocal 'CoverRepairTip'}}">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-trowel-bricks"></i> {{CPLocal "CoverRepairBtn"}}
        </button>
    </div>
    {{/if}}
    {{else}}
    <p class="cp-cover-pool-line">{{CPLocal "CoverPoolLine" pool=pool poolMax=poolMax}}</p>
    {{/if}}
</div>
